[{"title":"周仲翔和诗赠以前韵","author":"王十朋","text":"与子十年同把酒，贫贱未能离陇亩。\n今年依旧对黄花，会意何由笑开口。\n老来钟爱有三儿，迩岁从师得吾友。\n祝螟方拟为蠃飞，舐犊俄惊作牛吼。\n幼儿已作一觉梦，大匠徒施两年手。\n乙子沉痾赖营牧，再生岂止由南斗。\n嗟予屯厄世所弃，急难谁肯相先后。\n论交最喜子善终，报德深惭我无有。\n犹怜甲乙二孺子，莫景于渠意加厚。\n烦君为我严诲之，毋惜鞭笞九十九。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17089,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈献可宋孝先万孝杰夏伯虎和诗复用前韵","author":"王十朋","text":"准拟重阳会诗酒，手种菊花凡数亩。\n佳节相逢俱可人，一一篇章堪适口。\n扬庭酝籍更清新，晋宋间人颜谢友。\n舜卿词源浩万斛，下笔惊人风雨吼。\n季梁萧洒诗如人，飘然自是风骚手。\n用之年少富文墨，日出珠玑不论斗。\n诚叔思深希仲逸，齐驱未识谁先后。\n老朽那能敌年少，胸中空洞嗟无有。\n张我三军得数子，造物遗予非不厚。\n明年秋战岂无人，云梦定须吞八九。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17090,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日把酒十九人和诗者数人而已今已后期不复追索许以来年九日还用前韵发一笑","author":"王十朋","text":"劝君须饮文字酒，劝君耕耨心中亩。\n饮非文字犹聚蚊，心田不耕棘生口。\n登高佳节岂易得，况此相逢皆胜友。\n谈倾坐上冰玉清，兴生笔下波涛吼。\n我亦逢场聊戏剧，韵语殊非三昧手。\n试投瓦砾已成堆，辱报骊珠未盈斗。\n和之者寡岂阳春，高才料耻居王后。\n嗟我穷愁无以遣，酒债诗篇行处有。\n与兹饮会类平原，逃我诗盟几高厚。\n如今并许隔年还，直须日月逢重九。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17091,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋孝先示读自宽集复用前韵","author":"王十朋","text":"渊明酷爱尊中酒，季子贫无负郭亩。\n我生薄与二子同，俯仰人间亦缘口。\n一室萧然仅容膝，毛颖陶泓自相友。\n会心终日雌声读，排闷有时粗气吼。\n感秋诗集名自宽，雕琢更惭非妙手。\n篇章不工如子固，声名敢望星之斗。\n宋生辄作过情语，十韵殷勤为跋后。\n誉之韩柳谁敢当，意古语奇吾岂有。\n何如操矛时入室，针我膏肓乃相厚。\n床头周易深且神，毋惜往来论六九。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17092,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再用前韵述怀并简诸友","author":"王十朋","text":"太白徉狂喜杯酒，元龙豪气耻求亩。\n挥毫烂吐风月篇，济世高谈霸王口。\n古人可作谁与归，白也吾师登可友。\n万言窗下杯水冷，百尺楼头鼻声吼。\n丈夫未遇聊尔耳，肯向权门思炙手。\n净扫一室安吾贫，昼阅诗书夜星斗。\n休论生天与作佛，灵运甘居丈人后。\n吾侪慎分慕富贵，鸣鼓定须攻冉有。\n但愿相从文字乐，交情合向穷中厚。\n倚看前席坐间人，平步登瀛参二九。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17093,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑逊志胡叔成谢鹏刘敦信万廓邬一唯和诗复用前韵","author":"王十朋","text":"前日中秋一壶酒，交朋解散归南亩。\n把杯邀月止三人，中有客来从谷口。\n首登诗坛出险语，张我孤军真畏友。\n重阳佳句更奇绝，西风猛向松关吼。\n中庸伯始遥遥胄，颖然作赋吟诗手。\n谢客篇章似春草，分得家传才一斗。\n句法天然自圆熟，长庆诗豪今有后。\n妙龄能作老成语，必大奇儿亦希有。\n邬郡太守司马孙，文与其人两温厚。\n我与数子无薰莸，文字相从十常九。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17094,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日会饮予为唱首自和凡数篇皆因事叙情尔未作重九诗也今再和一篇每句用事而不见姓名末联外馀皆略存对偶必有能和之者","author":"王十朋","text":"独坐东篱叹无酒，种秫西畴谩盈亩。\n菊花丛畔来白衣，桑落杯中付馋口。\n汝南风俗有故事，龙山宴集多佳友。\n静闻彭泽三径香，遥想蓝田双涧吼。\n顺时习射马嘶风，随俗登山囊系手。\n慈恩塔冷旧衣冠，戏马台空古刁斗。\n三嗅馨香感槩中，细看茱萸酩酊后。\n应制赋诗人孰在，坐湖联句今还有。\n明朝见花心已别，此日登高意宜后。\n日月并应节物嘉，独恨今年无闰九。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17095,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"忆昔逢重九，登临不惮遥。\n弟兄同把酒，行乐兴飘飘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17096,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"去岁重九日，吾亲窀穸期。\n东篱自黄菊，泪眼可曾知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17097,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"此日黄花酒，深期酌弟兄。\n谁知有离别，西望不胜情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17098,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其四","author":"王十朋","text":"我有茱萸沜，遥同辋川底。\n登高少一人，又是王家弟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17099,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其五","author":"王十朋","text":"嘉节苦难遇，故山随俗登。\n未能如郑谷，一榻对高僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17100,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其六","author":"王十朋","text":"白石登山客，新诗句必豪。\n宁容杜陵老，独步玉山高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17101,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其七","author":"王十朋","text":"我思雁荡游，欲与雁行去。\n羽翼本天生，谁令分两处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17102,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其八","author":"王十朋","text":"乐事苦无多，良辰岂长见。\n明年缀席时，要使茱萸遍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17103,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其九","author":"王十朋","text":"庭前有晚菊，青蕊未堪插。\n开日即重阳，归来酒同呷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17104,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其十","author":"王十朋","text":"载酒觞黄菊，登山臂紫茱。\n重修汝南事，灾厄自今无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17105,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其十一","author":"王十朋","text":"老去悲秋甚，兴来聊自娱。\n明年知健否，子细看茱萸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17106,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其十二","author":"王十朋","text":"穷途嗟我衰，中岁伤儿夭。\n兄弟止三人，尊前岂宜少。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17107,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其十三","author":"王十朋","text":"嗅菊谩劳三，赐安得萸一。\n聊分故园枝，不负重阳日。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17108,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄昌龄弟 其十四","author":"王十朋","text":"节物岂不好，吾家何太贪。\n一尊聊尔寄，重意愧先人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17109,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万叔永诞日在孟秋，乃以重九开燕俟佳节也予不获与称觞之列作诗以贺","author":"王十朋","text":"种德尤胜窦十郎，灵椿未老桂先芳。\n一门此去无疑大，五福他年未易量。\n凤穴生雏梧正碧，龙山开宴菊初黄。\n吾乡此会从来少，恨不登堂举寿觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17110,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月十二夜独步梅溪玩月人迹悄然秋色满眼微风不动岩桂自香初不劳思偶得四句盖心境中静时语也归小成室对短灯檠索纸书之","author":"王十朋","text":"独步溪头夜初寂，扫空尘念心清凉。\n月明眼底见秋色，境静鼻根闻桂香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17111,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"前日寓邑偶值乍寒陈刘二生济我以衣童生济我以衾既别为二诗以赠 其一 赠陈元佐刘士宗","author":"王十朋","text":"肌体生鳞须飒毛，衰年怯冷欲儿号。\n无人来绽韩公袄，有友能施范叔袍。\n入手乍惊儒袖阔，披身尤喜义襟高。\n书生忍冻谁相顾，共弊轻裘赖我曹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17112,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"前日寓邑偶值乍寒陈刘二生济我以衣童生济我以衾既别为二诗以赠 其二 赠童伟侃","author":"王十朋","text":"凛冽霜风夜薄人，谁能煖我曲勾身。\n寒欺三幅范衾陋，睡美一宵姜被新。\n体粟不愁生旅舍，鼻雷想见撼比邻。\n梦回却念君兄弟，苫块无眠痛慕亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17113,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万先之生两男作洗儿歌贺之","author":"王十朋","text":"君不见徐卿二子生绝奇，熊罴入梦非同时。\n徒烦孔子与释氏，两回抱送麒麟儿。\n又不见昔日梁嬴亦双乳，生止一男仍一女。\n过期毕竟非其人，未免终身亦妾圉。\n郁葱佳气充门闾，龙穴盛事从来无。\n蓂阶良月吐三荚，蚌腹甲夜生双珠。\n相对抱持翁妪喜，眉目分明巧相似。\n慈颜戏语綵衣郎，汝子他年胜我子。\n郎君拜舞笑答翁，翁生六儿年岂同。\n何如今日一卮酒，手抱两孙头未童。\n二雏庆诞相先后，未省如何分长幼。\n商家尚质周尚文，唤取何休细推究。\n庆门兰玉行满庭，伯仲叔季双命名。\n他时四乳类周士，森森八桂同敷荣。\n我忝通家同笔砚，闻君得子欢无间。\n殷勤为作洗儿歌，觅取金钱三百万。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17114,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄府君挽词 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"不杂商山绮与园，生涯占得小桃源。\n平生隐德知多少，跨灶诜诜已六孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17115,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄府君挽词 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"纷然紾臂已成风，一爨谁能再世同。\n野史他年书逸事，定须记此富家翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17116,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄府君挽词 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"扬州别驾知名士，肝胆崔嵬百鍊刚。\n谁谓公家有兰玉，解令高选继东床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17117,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄府君挽词 其四","author":"王十朋","text":"齿发如公自古稀，定应含笑九原归。\n春风白石岩前路，忍见杨花作雪飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17118,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予自乙丑冬如临安赴补逮今凡五往矣是行也痛慈亲之不见伤幼儿之蚤死登途泫然因成是诗","author":"王十朋","text":"八岁五行役，兹行最感伤。\n思亲啼血泪，忆子断刚肠。\n游远有遗恨，钟情难遽忘。\n离家两夜梦，长绕白岩旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17119,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初拟过雁山既而取道乌石寄梦龄昌龄","author":"王十朋","text":"不度丹芳七七盘，非缘杖屦厌间关。\n要留来岁高风便，兄弟成行过此山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17120,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过白溪","author":"王十朋","text":"朝离黄塘憩乌石，莫宿青江过白溪。\n岭上回头观赤水，山川五色望中迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17121,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过盘山宿旅邸","author":"王十朋","text":"一岭迢迢十里赊，行人半日踏烟霞。\n青山遮莫盘千匝，归梦何曾不到家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17122,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登皇华亭","author":"王十朋","text":"不是四方衔命士，偶来亭上赋皇华。\n凭栏回首三百里，烟水茫茫思故家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17123,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿浮桥","author":"王十朋","text":"落日丹丘下，西江十里西。\n浮桥通古道，逆旅傍清溪。\n夜静水声细，晓阴山色迷。\n吾乡在何处，天远白云低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17124,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与郑时敏登楼把酒书二绝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"十里青山接郡城，危楼四望眼添明。\n海冥天阔乡心切，更听飞飞鸿雁声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17125,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与郑时敏登楼把酒书二绝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"登楼能赋非王粲，沽酒忘形有郑虔。\n千里相从文字饮，不辞费尽杖头钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17126,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"途中见早梅","author":"王十朋","text":"山行初逢建子月，始见寒梅第一枝。\n遥想吾庐亦如此，谁能千里赠相思。\n梅花发后思家切，竹间水际出横枝。\n暗香疏影和新月，自是离情禁不得，触物那堪此时节。\n春前腊后定归来，要看溪上千株雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17127,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙丑冬西游观南明石像作诗一绝至壬申十月四日复往观焉和前韵并书于佛阁","author":"王十朋","text":"儿戏团沙欲象真，谁将愿力历三尘。\n八年来往箫峰客，两度来瞻百尺身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17128,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西征","author":"王十朋","text":"绍兴建元二十二，良月壬午时丁未。\n王家辞弟游帝都，出门满眼思亲泪。\n鹡鸰送我过原隰，朋友携尊宿萧寺。\n朝离黄塘惜分别，莫宿青山嗟独自。\n初心满拟游雁山，行止非人辄乖异。\n黄岩留连越三宿，故旧过从日沈醉。\n郑生伴我千里行，近世人无此风义。\n皇华亭上一回首，陡觉眉头起乡思。\n西江十里浮桥边，把酒登楼吟拥鼻。\n山行初逢建子月，入眼梅花已春意。\n前观三渡觉非旧，下视两滩真可畏。\n渡头仙人还笑我，髭须如棘犹名利。\n欲入天台观石桥，行来匆匆未能遂。\n途中邂逅张老丞，十五年前乐清尉。\n自嗟吾非沈谢辈，面目从来苦难记。\n飞泉枕上梦成魔，达旦思家何曾睡。\n细雨濛濛入关岭，旅邸重寻旧题字。\n雨脚微收过天姥，洗出峰峦叠苍翠。\n刘阮祠荒土犹赤，溪山真是神仙地。\n道旁石现小金仙，传舍荒凉谁废置。\n柘溪竹染儿女痕，石岭松含栋梁器。\n路入南明观石佛，楼阁岧峣更深邃。\n八年行役两来游，岩上题诗记前事。\n乘兴剡溪寻故人，久别相逢杂悲喜。\n义风吹水送行舟，越国江山满瞻视。\n十四岁娥孝且烈，三百里湖明更媚。\n千岩竞秀壑争流，终日贪看趣遥寄。\n西兴渡口声如雷，银浪崔嵬魄惊悸。\n江神为我风色平，天阙煌煌瞻象魏。\n贤关访旧话酸辛，更食齑盐旧滋味。\n学官欲以职事留，自愧非才力辞避。\n观台云物端可书，宫线初长日南至。\n龙山僦舍观大礼，仪仗森然典文备。\n人臣贵盛古今无，秦公父子俱为使。\n景灵告谢乐声回，鹓鹭花枝侈君赐。\n西游连日睹天颜，和气氤氲散憔悴。\n岁云莫矣却归来，捉笔书为于役志。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17129,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"癸酉三月二十五日至剡溪旅舍观曹梦良题壁有撩我思家第一篇之句仆离家半月亦未尝作诗因次其韵","author":"王十朋","text":"客舍那堪闻杜鹃，梦魂惊断竟无眠。\n定知此境撩乡思，我亦曾非第二篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17130,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剡之市人以崇奉东岳为名设盗蹠以戏先圣所不忍观因书一绝","author":"王十朋","text":"里巷无端戏大儒，恨无司马为行诛。\n不知陈蔡当时厄，还似如今嵊县无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17131,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周德远植瑞香于窗前戏成一绝","author":"王十朋","text":"主人贪睡为贪香，花植窗前意味长。\n见说有时魂梦里，化为蝴蝶绕花旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17132,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游明心院","author":"王十朋","text":"精舍傍脩岭，道心随眼明。\n泉馀偃公迹，山接剡溪城。\n无雨竹亦净，有风松更清。\n谁名上方阁，撩我欲归情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17133,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游圆超院登挟溪亭次卢公韵","author":"王十朋","text":"路入剡山腰，风生玉川腋。\n孤亭物外高，双溪眼中碧。\n山僧作亭知几春，赏音端怕逢诗人。\n自从妙语发丘壑，遂使绝境多蹄轮。\n我来首访维摩诘，问讯双溪自何出。\n发源应与婺溪同，赋物惭无沈郎笔。\n凭栏欲洗名利尘，入眼翻惊客恨新。\n山城重重水如带，可能挽住思乡人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17134,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄梦龄昌龄弟","author":"王十朋","text":"老去生涯集百忧，一身萍泛剡溪头。\n钓鱼温水同侯喜，旅食新丰类马周。\n长铗有时思海味，短檠终夜照离愁。\n也知四海皆兄弟，能似天生羽翼不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17135,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高和叔生日","author":"王十朋","text":"高标绰有鲁王风，天为勋门庆诞公。\n挥麈笑谈倾坐上，传家韬略蕴匈中。\n暂从剡水高人隐，行继澶渊盖世功。\n长愿红颜似今日，寿尊鲸吸百川空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17136,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天子始絺","author":"王十朋","text":"盛德方居火，天王始服絺。\n薰风生殿早，畏日到官迟。\n瑩雪罗初叠，含风葛乍披。\n汗宁濡玉体，暑不近天肌。\n表饰遵尼父，恩荣彼拾遗。\n中宫同俭德，无愧葛覃诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17137,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其一 渊源堂","author":"王十朋","text":"像貌崇贤圣，名言训子孙。\n日亲师与友，力学探渊源。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17138,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其二 细论堂","author":"王十朋","text":"不饮红裙酒，祇将文字论。\n江东渭北客，日日对芳尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17139,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其三 宜桂轩","author":"王十朋","text":"主人端不俗，景物亦相宜。\n手种轩前桂，联芳共几枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17140,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其四 蕴秀轩","author":"王十朋","text":"剡溪蕴秀异，久郁少陵诗。\n今向轩前看，人如晋宋时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17141,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其五 同襟馆","author":"王十朋","text":"安道家何处，溪山深更深。\n扁舟不惮远，得得访同襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17142,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其六 富学斋","author":"王十朋","text":"金玉本非富，诗书元不贫。\n平生无尽用，学问在吾身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17143,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其七 辉声斋","author":"王十朋","text":"功名就烜赫，遗训可能忘。\n待献明光赋，蜚声满四方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17144,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其八 集彦斋","author":"王十朋","text":"独学恐孤陋，要须亲友朋。\n虚斋集群彦，共对短灯檠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17145,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其九 擢秀斋","author":"王十朋","text":"好似东山谢，满庭芝与兰。\n义方能不倦，擢秀固非难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17146,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其十 恢义斋","author":"王十朋","text":"忆昔杜陵老，恨无千万间。\n君能恢大义，吾党悉欢颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17147,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其十一 兰馨室","author":"王十朋","text":"一室虽方丈，游从必舜徒。\n芬馨不自觉，身化与之俱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17148,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊源堂十二诗 其十二 足鲤池","author":"王十朋","text":"堂上论文客，异时还索居。\n池中鲤鱼足，好寄别来书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17149,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]